# auto-ammo: the saved game the auto-ammo enhanced session starts from. A new character, as the
# newgame session makes one (every default, the name Avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): 10 sling stones (0x10) into the pack, the player
# moved to (19, 51) on level 1, two squares south of the castle's door at (19, 53), and 5 more
# sling stones dropped at their feet. Saved in slot 1, described "ammo"
14000 key esc
16500 key esc
20000 key enter        # Create Character
24000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
27000 key enter        # the difficulty
30000 key enter
33000 key enter
36000 key enter
39000 key enter
42000 key enter
45000 key enter
48000 key a            # the name
48200 key v
48400 key a
48600 key t
48800 key a
49000 key r
50000 key enter
53000 key enter        # Yes
60100 cheat give 0x10 10
60300 cheat goto 1 19 51
61500 cheat give 0x10 5 drop
64000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot 1, "ammo"
64100 key s
64300 up ctrl
66000 key enter
67500 key a
67700 key m
67900 key m
68100 key o
69000 key enter
